_score(X_pca, labels)\n","        calinski_harabasz_scores[n_components].append(calinski_harabasz)\n","\n","        print(f\"PCA komponente: {n_components}, Broj klastera: {n_clusters}, Silhouette Score: {silhouette:.4f}, Davies-Bouldin Score: {davies_bouldin:.4f}, Calinski-Harabasz Score: {calinski_harabasz:.4f}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"6ZfFgQPC0PcM","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1768224068777,"user_tz":-60,"elapsed":616771,"user":{"displayName":"Tarik Čaluk","userId":"13670397337889075330"}},"outputId":"82377adf-b14d-43fb-a432-9f50efed64e7"},"execution_count":20,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["PCA komponente: 2, Broj klastera: 2, Silhouette Score: 0.4385, Davies-Bouldin Score: 1.1174, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 15490.5172\n","PCA komponente: 2, Broj klastera: 3, Silhouette Score: 0.2502, Davies-Bouldin Score: 1.2143, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 13603.4643\n","PCA komponente: 2, Broj klastera: 4, Silhouette Score: 0.2774, Davies-Bouldin Score: 1.0789, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 15132.3490\n","PCA komponente: 5, Broj klastera: 2, Silhouette Score: 0.2407, Davies-Bouldin Score: 1.8682, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 5980.6289\n","PCA komponente: 5, Broj klastera: 3, Silhouette Score: 0.2249, Davies-Bouldin Score: 1.4031, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 5199.5614\n","PCA komponente: 5, Broj klastera: 4, Silhouette Score: 0.1752, Davies-Bouldin Score: 1.7068, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 5293.8719\n","PCA komponente: 10, Broj klastera: 2, Silhouette Score: 0.1326, Davies-Bouldin Score: 2.6658, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 3038.5317\n","PCA komponente: 10, Broj klastera: 3, Silhouette Score: 0.0692, Davies-Bouldin Score: 2.5645, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 2498.1009\n","PCA komponente: 10, Broj klastera: 4, Silhouette Score: 0.0795, Davies-Bouldin Score: 2.2334, Calinski-Harabasz Score: 2348.4438\n","PCA komponente: 20, Broj klastera: 2, Silhouette Score: 0.1662, Davies-Bouldin Score: 2.5923, Calinski-Harabasz Score